# The build context for deploy/docker/*.Dockerfile.
#
# The server and task images COPY the whole tree and compile Go; the Python
# image copies one file. None of them needs the dashboard, the git history or
# anything machine-local, so all of that stays out: a context without
# web/node_modules is a fraction of the size, and a context without .env files
# cannot copy a local credential into a build layer.
.git
web/
**/node_modules
.env
.env.*
.claude/
bin/
dist/
*.out
coverage*
